 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >命运之日，不祥的征兆降临兔子村。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >若你无法阻止，村民们将惨遭恶魔大军的屠戮……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.poster.avif?t=1788149163\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.webm?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.mp4?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Sephiria》是一款直面命运的动作肉鸽游戏，讲述一只勇敢的兔子为将家园从毁灭中拯救而踏上的旅程。精通并强化各式武器，每一局解锁全新天赋，策略性地布置你的物品栏，杀出重重敌群，揭开旅途尽头潜藏的威胁真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.poster.avif?t=1788149163\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.webm?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.mp4?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >特色</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>策略物品栏系统：</strong>收集并摆放神器，用不同的碑文强化它们。按你的战斗风格打造专属物品栏！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>自由战斗：</strong>精通 6 种风格迥异的武器，每种都有超过 50 项独特升级等你解锁！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>千变万化的威胁：</strong>迎战 60 多种各具特色的危险敌人与 10 多个独特 Boss。在横跨 6 个章节的旅程中，挑战愈发严峻。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>携手好友：</strong>最多 4 人在线合作，一同探索高塔。交换道具、复活倒下的同伴，作为团队赢得胜利！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.poster.avif?t=1788149163\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.webm?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.mp4?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >命运之日，不祥的征兆降临兔子村。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >若你无法阻止，村民们将惨遭恶魔大军的屠戮……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.poster.avif?t=1788149163\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.webm?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.mp4?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Sephiria》是一款直面命运的动作肉鸽游戏，讲述一只勇敢的兔子为将家园从毁灭中拯救而踏上的旅程。精通并强化各式武器，每一局解锁全新天赋，策略性地布置你的物品栏，杀出重重敌群，揭开旅途尽头潜藏的威胁真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.poster.avif?t=1788149163\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.webm?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.mp4?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >特色</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>策略物品栏系统：</strong>收集并摆放神器，用不同的碑文强化它们。按你的战斗风格打造专属物品栏！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>自由战斗：</strong>精通 6 种风格迥异的武器，每种都有超过 50 项独特升级等你解锁！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>千变万化的威胁：</strong>迎战 60 多种各具特色的危险敌人与 10 多个独特 Boss。在横跨 6 个章节的旅程中，挑战愈发严峻。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>携手好友：</strong>最多 4 人在线合作，一同探索高塔。交换道具、复活倒下的同伴，作为团队赢得胜利！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.poster.avif?t=1788149163\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.webm?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.mp4?t=1788149163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
 "short_description": "《Dungreed》原班人马打造的俯视角动作 RPG 肉鸽游戏。潜入高塔深处探索，收集并强化神器，击退成群涌来的恶魔，守护危在旦夕的兔子村！",
